totally notice if it's too clutter like I'll&nbsp;
just notice something's off but ion know why&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:30.800 --> 00:07:39.560
yeah how many written pages is a comic book is&nbsp;
there a standard well I mean comic books today&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:39.560 --> 00:07:47.600
typically are 20 pages of story there's a the&nbsp;
20 page stories there's also a new movement to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:47.600 --> 00:07:53.360
have thicker comics like almost double-sized&nbsp;
like 40 page books so today a book is either&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:53.360 --> 00:08:03.560
maybe around 20 pages or around 40 pages but&nbsp;
but when you say written a script that I will&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:03.560 --> 00:08:12.160
write for a comic it's pretty much like one for&nbsp;
one a 20 page comic might take about 20 pages&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:12.160 --> 00:08:19.400
of script how long does it take you to write a&nbsp;
